          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Enkig 2.26–3.11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kulo apa ilaiguanak le ina kop, ootimira iltung'ana le Israel, neya ina kop enye te lido kekun Yordan te nkalo e nkilepunoto e nkolong ebaiki oerata le Arnon o metabaiki oldoinyo le Hermon, o Araba pooki te nkalo o loosaen: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihon olaiguanani loo Lamori apa omanya Heshbon, naa ninye apa oitore ebaiki Aroer natii olomanaa lo erata le Arnon, o metabaiki empolos o erata o metabaiki olkeju le Yabok, ilo polosie loo Lamori, aa taa, olpisiai le Gilead, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Araba o metabaiki enaiposha e Kineret te nkalo o loo saen, o te nkalo e Bet-yeshimot, o metabaiki enaiposha e Araba, ina aiposha naisukut, enkalo e kopikop o metabaiki abori lelo jurumi le Pisga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Oog olaiguanani le Bashan, obo apa lo lpisiai le Refaim, apa omanya Ashtarot o Edrei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ninye apa oitore oldoinyo le Hermon o Saleka o Bashan pooki o metabaiki olpolosie loo Lkishi o Lmaakati, o lpisiai le Gilead o metabaiki olpolosie le Sihon olaiguanani le Heshbon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 32.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 3.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Etimira apa ninche Musa osinka lo Laitoriani te nebo iltung'ana le Israel; neishooyo Musa ilo sinka lo Laitoriani enkop enye metaa enkop oo le Ruben, ole Gad olpisiai lo losho le Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilaiguanak ootimira Yoshua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kulo apa ilaiguanak le ina kop ootimira Yoshua o ltung'ana le Israel te nkalo o loontoluo le Yordan, ebaiki Baal-gad ti atua oerata le Lebanon o metabaiki ilo doinyo le Halak, oshumunye aing'or Seir (neisho Yoshua ina kop enye iloshon le Israel meitaa enenye te risioroto enkiririkinoto enye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ti atua ina kop nagum, ti atua Araba, o tiatua nkishong'ishong'at, ti atua ong'ata ooti atua negeb, ina kop oo Lhiti, o Lamori, o Lkanaani, o Lperisi, o Lhafi o Lyebusi): ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olaiguanani le Yeriko; obo, olaiguanani le Ai aa ninye natashare Betel, obo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olaiguanani le Yerusalem, obo; olaiguanani le Hebron, obo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olaiguanani le Yarmut, obo; olaiguanani le Lakish, obo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olaiguanani le Eglon, obo; olaiguanani le Geser, obo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olaiguanani le Debir, obo; olaiguanani le Geder, obo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olaiguanani le Horma, obo; olaiguanani le Aradi, obo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olaiguanani le Libna, obo; olaiguanani le Adulam, obo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
